{"id":203702022588450,"type":"album","name":"MONTERO","artist":"Lil Nas X","year":2021,"weight":10,"info":{"cover":"https://dn721608.ca.archive.org/0/items/mbid-d87a61cd-5201-4a7d-9b4c-a4b676c315bf/mbid-d87a61cd-5201-4a7d-9b4c-a4b676c315bf-30432380663.jpg","aoty":81,"aoty_user":71,"yt":"9YSgwSS5iN8","links":{"aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/348440-lil-nas-x-montero.php"},"desc":"MONTERO is the debut studio album by American rapper and singer Lil Nas X, released on September 17, 2021, by Columbia Records. It was supported by the singles \"MONTERO (Call Me by Your Name)\", \"SUN GOES DOWN\", \"INDUSTRY BABY (feat. Jack Harlow)\", and \"THATS WHAT I WANT\", the first and third of which topped the US Billboard Hot 100 while the latter reached the top 10. The album has been mostly described as a pop rap record by critics. Primarily rooted in hip-hop and pop, the hook-dominated album incorporates trap beats and distorted hard rock, and draws elements from 2000s R&B and stadium ballads. It features guest appearances from Jack Harlow, Doja Cat, Elton John, Megan Thee Stallion, and Miley Cyrus. Upon ."},"artist_ref":{"id":162258569481682,"name":"Lil Nas X","info":{"img":null}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":210192360016800,"type":"genre","name":"Alternative Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":2664,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":136937573393074,"type":"genre","name":"hip hop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":1554,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":176578125596945,"type":"genre","name":"Contemporary R&B","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":327,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":249056050558872,"type":"genre","name":"Pop Rap","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":262,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"}],"lists":[{"id":55158258843870,"name":"AOTY Must Hear 2020s","src":"charts","grp":"AOTY","list_year":null,"rank":514,"year":2021,"note":null,"total":683,"scaruffi":null},{"id":85122334056025,"name":"Grammy Award: Album of the Year nominees","src":"musthear","grp":"musicbrain